# Environment configuration example.
#
# No real secrets belong in this file or in this repository.
# Copy to .env locally and fill in real values; .env is gitignored.
#
# Backend, frontend, database, queue and storage infrastructure have not
# been implemented yet (TASK-001 is repository bootstrap only). Actual
# configuration variables will be introduced by the tasks that implement
# each piece of infrastructure (TASK-002 backend, TASK-003 frontend,
# TASK-004 local environment, TASK-005 PostgreSQL, TASK-006 Redis/queue).

# --- Application (placeholder, to be defined in TASK-002/003) ---
# APP_ENV=local
# APP_URL=http://localhost:8000

# --- Database (to be defined in TASK-005) ---
# DB_CONNECTION=pgsql

# --- Cache / Queue (to be defined in TASK-006) ---
# REDIS_HOST=

# --- File storage (to be defined when object storage adapter is implemented) ---
# FILESYSTEM_DISK=
